            "smithy.api#documentation": "\n You can use a simplified version:\n```json\n{\n    \"properties\": [\n        {\n            \"key\": \"email\",\n            \"value\": \"x@y.com\",\n            \"operator\": \"exact\",\n            \"type\": \"event\"\n        }\n    ]\n}\n```\n\nOr you can create more complicated queries with AND and OR:\n```json\n{\n    \"properties\": {\n        \"type\": \"AND\",\n        \"values\": [\n            {\n                \"type\": \"OR\",\n                \"values\": [\n                    {\"key\": \"email\", ...},\n                    {\"key\": \"email\", ...}\n                ]\n            },\n            {\n                \"type\": \"AND\",\n                \"values\": [\n                    {\"key\": \"email\", ...},\n                    {\"key\": \"email\", ...}\n                ]\n            }\n        ]\n    ]\n}\n```\n\n\n* `AND` - AND\n* `OR` - OR"
